OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of Man election: Polls closed
OL,4,Ain House of Keys vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoting has closed in the 2026 Isle of
OL,7,FMan general election.
OL,9,FVoters are electing 24 members of the
OL,10,FHouse of Keys, two in each of the
OL,11,Fisland's 12 constituencies, who will
OL,12,Fserve in the Manx parliament for the
OL,13,Fnext five years.
OL,15,FA total of 82 candidates are contesting
OL,16,Fthe election. For the first time,
OL,17,Fvoters were able to cast their ballot
OL,18,Fat any polling station within their
OL,19,Fconstituency.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
