OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of Man election: Polls closed
OL,4,Ain House of Keys vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoters had 12 hours to cast their
OL,7,Fvotes, between 08:00 BST and 20:00.
OL,8,FCounting is now under way.
